         <abstract id="aspace_4e1a0bcab5c7a635f03a7af9218dd76e">This collection comprises bookplates and other works by the artist Adri de Ruijter (sometimes spelled Adri de Ruyter), who was active in Holland in the mid-20th century.</abstract>
